[TITLE]
CONDITIONAL Xinyi study: equivalent reservoirs, NOT actual Taipei sewer connections.
Rain is applied ONLY to 2D. API stage forcing is required; INP alone is not reproduction.
Each independent reservoir uses local base 0 m and surface 2 m, NOT surveyed elevations.
END_TIME has a 2-second scheduling guard; the driver stops at 25200 seconds.
[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CMS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
START_DATE 01/01/2020
START_TIME 00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE 01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE 01/01/2020
END_TIME 07:00:02
REPORT_STEP 00:01:00
WET_STEP 00:00:01
DRY_STEP 00:00:01
ROUTING_STEP 1.0
MINIMUM_STEP 0.001
VARIABLE_STEP 0
LENGTHENING_STEP 0
MIN_SURFAREA 0
HEAD_TOLERANCE 0.00001
SURCHARGE_METHOD EXTRAN
MAX_TRIALS 40
ALLOW_PONDING NO
THREADS 1
[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT 0

